SUMMARY:Mike Glazer "Self-Destructs" Stand-Up Comedy Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:When Kanye West shared Mike Glazer’s joke\, he thought his life was about to change. And it did\, in the worst way imaginable\, until Taylor Swift’s Swifties saved his life (and his engagement). \nMike Glazer is chaotic good: a twisted\, endearing storyteller like an evil Mike Birbiglia. This is the first show in his new series about his very weird life as a strip-club–sponsored roller hockey goalie who almost became an Olympian\, a prank gone wrong that shared his phone number with the entire world\, somehow becoming the CIA for a month on Instagram\, and trying to marry the creator of Netflix’s hit show Is It Cake? \nIf you’ve ever wanted to hear the words\, “so the Swifties were battling the Nazis\,” come to this show. As Kanye said\, “it’s good deal.”
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/mike-glazer-self-destructs-stand-up-comedy-live-the-melon-ball/
