SUMMARY:Stronger Bones + Better Recovery Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special one-time community event at Thrive designed to help you move better\, feel stronger\, and learn practical tools for long-term health and injury prevention. \nEvent Includes:\n30-Minute Bone Strength Fitness Class\nLearn safe\, effective jumping and impact techniques designed to help support and increase bone density while improving power\, balance\, and athletic movement.\nRecovery + Injury Prevention Workshop \nStay after class for an interactive workshop featuring recovery education\, injury prevention strategies with US Cryotherapy\, plus tips for staying strong\, mobile\, and active. \nAll Are Welcome! \nWhether you’re an athlete\, active adult\, parent\, or simply looking to learn more about building strength and longevity — this event is for you.
