SUMMARY:HerScope Women's Health Expo
DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn about women’s health research\, professions\, and experiences! \nThis event is intended to give opportunities to students and community members to connect with different kinds of professionals (professors\, clinicians\, researchers\, etc). All attendees have the opportunity to be entered into a raffle (YoloBerry\, Little Gem Waffles\, Pachamama\, Fluffy Donuts\, Davis Creamery gift cards)\, and the event will be held in a booth style format where attendees can freely rotate around to explore. \nHosted by HerScope at UC Davis – a Registered Student Organization at UC Davis dedicated to advocating and educating about women’s health from a scientific lens. \nFREE ENTRY
