SUMMARY:Chocolate & Wine Pairing
DESCRIPTION:Wine & Chocolate Pairing Experience\nSaturday\, May 30 | 12–5pm \nA decadent tasting experience celebrating the harmony between fine wine and silky Lindt chocolates. \nEach pairing has been carefully chosen to delight your senses\, bringing together the rich textures of chocolate with the expressive flavors of our handcrafted wines. Take your time\, savor each sip and bite\, and discover how sweetness\, texture\, and aroma come together in perfect balance. \n🍇 Suggested Pairings Include:\n🤍 White Chocolate + Sparkling Brut (Méthode Champenoise)\nCrisp bubbles meet creamy sweetness for a smooth\, elegant finish.\n🤎 Caramel Chocolate + Malbec\nRich cherry\, blackberry\, and plum notes layered with warm baking spice and caramel.\n💚 Pistachio Chocolate + White Port-Style Dessert Wine\nNutty\, aromatic\, and silky with a honeyed finish.\n🖤 70% Dark Chocolate + Ruby Port-Style Dessert Wine\nDeep\, bold\, and beautifully balanced.\n🥂 Prefer to keep it sparkling?\nYou may enjoy two flutes of our Sparkling Brut instead of the full pairing experience!\nSlow down\, savor every sip and bite\, and discover the magic that happens when exceptional wine meets luxurious chocolate. Whether you’re planning a date\, gathering with friends\, or simply treating yourself\, this is the perfect way to spend a spring afternoon in the vineyard.\nRaise a glass\, unwrap a truffle\, and indulge in something unforgettable.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/chocolate-wine-pairing-3/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4-19-26-Thumbnail.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
GEO:38.5818013;-121.7499687
