SUMMARY:Misner & Smith at The Sofia
DESCRIPTION:Misner & Smith to perform music from critically acclaimed new album in Sacramento \nThe Sofia presents Misner & Smith\nMay 30th\, 2026 | 7p  \nFresh off the release of their critically acclaimed new album\,“All is Song”\, Northern California based unclassifiable duo Misner & Smith return to Sacramento. \nWith “All is Song” they turn in their finest work to date—an album of inspired declarations to the power of music\, song\, and collaboration. Co-produced with multi-instrumentalist Bruce Kaphan (American Music Club\, David Byrne\, The Black Crowes)\, the album is full of technically precise songwriting mirrored with an improvisatory spirit and their live shows are no different. \nThe beauty of their vocal harmonies combined with truly inventive songwriting has made the band one of the most inspiring acts in the Americana world. Blending elements of that genre with rock\, traditional folk\, and more pop-leaning ideas\, Misner & Smith makes music gloriously nonconforming.  \nGET TICKETS HERE. \n“Misner & Smith search deeply in their songwriting\, and their music is beautiful complex poetry.” – Americana Highways  \nGlide Magazine premiered “Anthem” writing\,“Poetic lyrics jump off the track and paint vivid images for a lead single that encompasses the many emotions of evolving as a person.”  \n“…This duo capture the spirit of classic songwriters like Fleetwood Mac and Joni Mitchell in the best ways possible.”- Chorus FM \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/misner-smith-at-the-sophia/
LOCATION:The Sofia\, Sacramento
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/40-All-is-Song-Misner-Smith-photo-by-gianteyephotography-high-res-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
